# Endgame Chest, Sanavixx method (https://sanavixx.com/crafting/) as the project owner crafts it:
#   1. Warlord piece: elevated mana-cost suffix only -> bench lock + scour -> magic.
#   2. Hunter piece: elevated T1 attack crit.
#   3. Hinekora previews on the Awakener: farm a T1-T2 resistance third suffix with an open prefix.
#   4. Bench "Suffixes Cannot Be Changed" + ONE Harvest reforge Caster (guaranteed curse).
#   5. 2 open prefixes -> Foulborn exalt, 1 open -> bench (56-74)% armour, full -> keep it.
#   6. Six-link beastcraft, Omen of Blanching.
include "lib/endgame_chest_parts.craft"

warlord_piece()
hunter_piece()
merge_farm_third_suffix()
curse_reforge()
fill_prefixes()
finish()

goal has "Warlord: mana cost" elevated and has "Hunter: attack crit" elevated and has "Hunter: additional curse"
track "good third suffix (T1-T2 fire/cold/lightning/chaos res or Warlord all res)" has "fire res" tier <= 2 or has "cold res" tier <= 2 or has "lightning res" tier <= 2 or has "chaos res" tier <= 2 or has "Warlord: all res" tier <= 2
track "prefixes full after the reforge (nothing crafted)" crafted_count == 0
